{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11102040","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11102040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110204001:0":{"text":"선배님, 제가 도울 게 있을까요?","source_cn":"前辈，有没有什么我能帮上——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815B40D4A12CCF76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110204002:0":{"text":"여러분, 진전이 좀 있나요? 비석에 석양의 신의 전설이 기록되어 있는 거 맞죠?","source_cn":"两位，有进展了吗？石碑上是残阳神的传说，没错吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x989EEA53B14BC1DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110204003:0":{"text":"“극강의 명예를 얻고, 친족의 피를 바쳐, 석양의 증거를 얻다.”","source_cn":"“获至强之誉，献同源之血，得残阳之证。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BB6F9143CC7D6A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110204004:0":{"text":"이 비석에 새겨진 글을 여러분의 말로 해석하면 대략 이런 뜻이에요.","source_cn":"——这块石碑上的字符，按你们的话说应该是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377C99B5A39D0DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者米尼亚":{"text":"상록수 학회 학자 미니아","source":"冬青学者米尼亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冬青学者瑞韦恩":{"text":"상록수 학자 레베인","source":"冬青学者瑞韦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_c